sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS edge termination
    participant Sidecar as llm-d-routing-sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS 1.2+
    participant Allowlist as AllowlistValidator<br/>(in-process)
    participant Prefiller as Remote vLLM Prefiller<br/>header-specified/TCP<br/>HTTP or HTTPS
    participant Decoder as Local vLLM Decoder<br/>8001/TCP (default)<br/>HTTP or HTTPS

    Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 1: Disaggregated Prefill/Decode (NIXL v2)

    Client->>Route: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Header: x-prefiller-host-port
    Route->>Sidecar: Forward (TLS terminated)

    Sidecar->>Allowlist: Validate prefiller target IP<br/>(InferencePool pod check)
    Allowlist-->>Sidecar: Allowed ✓

    Note over Sidecar: Modify request:<br/>max_tokens=1<br/>stream=false<br/>kv_transfer_params.do_remote_decode=true

    Sidecar->>Prefiller: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(modified params)<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+
    Prefiller-->>Sidecar: Response with<br/>kv_transfer_params metadata

    Note over Sidecar: Extract KV cache metadata<br/>Inject into decode request

    Sidecar->>Decoder: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(original + kv_transfer_params)<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+
    Decoder-->>Sidecar: Inference Response
    Sidecar-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 2: Direct Decode (No Prefill Header)

    Client->>Route: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>(no x-prefiller-host-port)
    Route->>Sidecar: Forward (TLS terminated)

    Note over Sidecar: No prefiller header detected<br/>Passthrough to decoder

    Sidecar->>Decoder: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+
    Decoder-->>Sidecar: Inference Response
    Sidecar-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>Client: JSON Response
